      "message": "I believe this will update all repositories within chromeos to the revision used as of 3744666, which may be a *lot* more changes than people are expecting. I got a message stating: `[chromiumos/chromite] 3744666/13 depends on 441 unmerged changes`\n\nOne of the two options below may be easier:\n1. Cherry pick only this change on top of chromite @ cros/main: `git fetch https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/chromite refs/changes/66/3744666/13 \u0026\u0026 git cherry-pick FETCH_HEAD`\n2. Just check out the specified version as a branch (in this case you wouldn\u0027t need the `git checkout main` or `git pull`) `git fetch https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/chromite refs/changes/66/3744666/13 \u0026\u0026 git checkout -b change-3744666 FETCH_HEAD`",
